<title>USA: J.C. Penney Dec same-store sales rise.</title>
<headline>J.C. Penney Dec same-store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>PLANO, Texas 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>			1996	 1995     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	     $3,572     $2,900    + 23.2	+ 6.2</p>
<p>Nine Weeks	$6,458     $5,617    + 15.0	+ 4.5</p>
<p>Year-to-date   $20,954    $19,548     + 7.2	+ 2.9</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>Month is four weeks ended Dec. 28, 1996.</p>
<p>Full company name is J.C. Penney Co Inc.</p>
<p>Same-store sales reflect results of department store unit. Total sales and dollar figures include drug store results.  </p>
<p>J.C. Penney's drug stores reported four week and nine week same-store sales of 5.9 percent and 5.8 percent, respectively. For the 48 week period, the drug stores reported same-store sales of 6.9 percent.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk  212-859-1610</p>
</text>
